      "updated": 1777191777353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "let -> block scoped, TDZ, globsl outside , do not attach to globalObject\n    redeclaraiotn not possible in same block,new binding per iteration \n\nconst-> same as let but reassignment not possible\n\nvar-> globalscoped ,returns undefined when accessed early,attached to global Object\n       can be redeclared and reassigned , shared binding, can not be deleted\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "let -> block scoped, TDZ, globsl outside , do not attach to globalObject\n    redeclaraiotn not possible in same block,new binding per iteration \n\nconst-> same as let but reassignment not possible\n\nvar-> globalscoped ,returns undefined when accessed early,attached to global Object\n       can be redeclared and reassigned , shared binding, can not be deleted\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
